1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:02,144
Okay!
Let's go!

2
00:00:05,282 --> 00:00:06,282
(Amy:)Bye.

3
00:00:06,283 --> 00:00:07,553
(Amy:)Bye.

4
00:00:07,551 --> 00:00:08,851
(Amy:)I'll miss you.

5
00:00:08,853 --> 00:00:10,153
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I'll miss you, too.

6
00:00:10,154 --> 00:00:11,484
(Amy:)I'll miss you more.

7
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:13,589
(Sheldon:)Well, if X equals the amount
that you'll miss me,

8
00:00:13,591 --> 00:00:15,221
(Sheldon:)then I'll miss you X plus one.

9
00:00:15,226 --> 00:00:18,196
(Amy:)If you miss me X plus one,
I'll miss you

10
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:20,765
(Amy:)open paren X plus one,
close paren to the second...

11
00:00:23,634 --> 00:00:25,834
(Leonard:)Thank you.

12
00:00:33,738 --> 00:00:35,708
(Sheldon:)You're sad, so I made you tea.

13
00:00:36,708 --> 00:00:38,308
(Bernadette (on phone):)Thanks.

14
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,170
(Sheldon:)And it's just the way
you like it.

15
00:00:40,548 --> 00:00:42,018
(Leonard:)Earl Grey?
Yes.

16
00:00:42,016 --> 00:00:43,016
(Leonard:)Honey?
Yes.

17
00:00:43,017 --> 00:00:43,947
(Leonard:)Unsweetened almond...
Good Lord!

18
00:00:43,951 --> 00:00:46,621
(Sheldon:)I made you tea.
Just drink it!

19
00:00:48,456 --> 00:00:50,326
(Leonard:)Sorry, thank you.

20
00:00:50,324 --> 00:00:54,094
(Sheldon:)Well, what can we do
to cheer you up?

21
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:56,065
(Leonard:)I really don't know.

22
00:00:56,063 --> 00:00:58,133
You want to play Jenga?

